[indent]•  [color=#000000]曹操[/color]：疼爱至深，有传位之意，曹冲死后哀甚，悔杀华佗。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]曹丕[/color]：宽慰曹操，却获父言"汝曹之幸"；后称"若使仓舒在，我亦无天下"（《魏略》裴注）——关系微妙，曹冲之死客观上利于曹丕。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000][color=#0066FF][url={"research": "曹植", "cat": "people"}]曹植[/url][/color][/color]：作《仓舒诔》悼念，"十三而卒，何辜于天，景命不遂"。[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
